@startuml
title Enter a name
actor "Dee" as dee
participant "Chat" as app

dee -> app : connect
app --> dee : open session
dee -> app : replace session /name <name>
alt the name is blank
  app --> dee : a name is needed
else another connected person has that name
  app --> dee : that name is in use
else
  app --> dee : patch session replace /name "Dee"
  app --> dee : open lobby
  note right of dee : the lobby shows which rooms have people in them;\na room's name is still typed
end
note over dee : only Dee has session open: nobody else is told
@enduml
